 "resolved": [
  {
   "date": "2026-09-15",
   "what": "Five verse-range differences between the printed edition and the Torah Units Dataset, now resolved in favour of the printed tables.",
   "reasoning": "In each case the dataset’s range had been copied from the unit heading in the printed edition, and that heading disagreed with the verses actually set in the unit’s table. The cells_detail map in the same dataset record already agreed with the table, so the dataset contradicted itself. In four of the five the heading also cut a cell in the middle, which the table structure does not allow. The dataset was corrected to agree with the tables in version 1.1; the headings in the source document have not been changed and are still listed below.",
